 "remarks": "Step into this charming 1940 Colonial nestled in a quiet Springdale neighborhood, set on a peaceful corner lot with a level yard. Retaining its vintage appeal with period details such as arched doorways, this beautifully updated 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home boasts warm, refinished hardwood floors throughout. The gracious formal living room features a cozy wood-burning fireplace and French doors leading to the sunroom, perfect for a home office or curling up with a good book. The formal dining room flows into the renovated white kitchen, featuring quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast bar that opens to the adjacent family room with sliders to the patio and yard. Upstairs, discover three bedrooms, including a primary suite with new hardwood flooring, a walk-in closet, and an updated en-suite bath. Two additional bedrooms and a hall bath complete this level. The lower level offers flexible space for a playroom, gym, or recreation room. The location can't be beat, within walking distance to the Springdale train station and a variety of dining and shopping options. A wonderful blend of vintage charm and modern comforts, this inviting home is ready for its next chapter.",
